{
  "uid": "nginx",
  "title": "Nginx e tráfego HTTP",
  "description": "Requisições e conexões dos três Nginx (Nginx Prometheus Exporter + stub_status).",
  "tags": [
    "monitoramento-nginx"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m"
    ]
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Estado",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": [],
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Estado de cada Nginx (nginx_up)",
      "description": "nginx_up = 1 quando o exporter conseguiu ler o stub_status do Nginx local; 0 quando não (Nginx parado ou endpoint inacessível).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 16,
          "valueSize": 18
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "nginx_up",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Requisições e distribuição do balanceamento",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": [],
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taxa de requisições por Nginx",
      "description": "nginx_http_requests_total conta todas as requisições desde que o Nginx ligou (só cresce). rate(...[1m]) = requisições por segundo, média do último minuto. O lb deve ter aproximadamente a soma de A e B.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^lb( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8F8F8F"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-a( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3274D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-b( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#FF9830"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(nginx_http_requests_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Round robin: servidor A × servidor B",
      "description": "Mesma métrica, só para os backends (vm=~\"srv-a|srv-b\"), no mesmo painel. Com round robin, as duas linhas devem ficar praticamente sobrepostas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 10,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^lb( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8F8F8F"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-a( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3274D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-b( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#FF9830"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(nginx_http_requests_total{vm=~\"srv-a|srv-b\"}[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Distribuição no período (A × B)",
      "description": "increase(...[$__range]) = quantas requisições cada backend recebeu no intervalo selecionado no topo do dashboard. Mostra a proporção da distribuição.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^lb( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8F8F8F"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-a( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3274D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-b( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#FF9830"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "pieType": "donut",
        "displayLabels": [
          "percent"
        ],
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "values": [
            "value"
          ]
        },
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "round(sum by (vm) (increase(nginx_http_requests_total{vm=~\"srv-a|srv-b\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Conexões",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "panels": [],
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Conexões ativas",
      "description": "nginx_connections_active = conexões abertas neste instante (gauge, usado direto). Inclui as ociosas em keep-alive.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
